nodes.draw({"position": {"column": 0, "row": 116}, "ascii": "[E] DiagramEditService: edits and resolution\n|-- openCanvasContext(savedSnapshot)\n|   `-- Bind live editing to durable history\n|-- edit(contextId, operation)\n|   |-- Resolve current diagram state\n|   |-- Apply content / metadata / link change\n|   |-- Match surviving logical nodes\n|   |-- Validate mappings and reconcile affected references\n|   |-- Persist new DiagramRevision\n|   |-- Persist canvas checkpoint selecting that revision\n|   `-- Advance context head; notify renderer\n|-- Canvas-only edit\n|   |-- Controller computes layout / connection change\n|   `-- Persist checkpoint reusing unchanged diagram revisions\n|-- checkpoint / restore\n|   |-- Coordinate diagram bindings and canvas state\n|   `-- Retain old branches after undo followed by another edit\n`-- DiagramResolver.forContext(contextId).get(diagramId)\n    |-- Read context's current snapshot\n    |-- Resolve private diagram binding\n    |-- Return content, source context and logical references\n    |-- Original canvas edits use its live context\n    |-- Completed edits persist before publication\n    |-- Ordinary editing does not invoke publication-time merge\n    `-- Camera motion / selection do not create content revisions", "structureKind": "tree"});
